      "question": "<p>(a) Find the first 4 terms, in ascending powers of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, in the binomial expansion of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1 + kx)^{10}\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a non-zero constant. Write each coefficient as simply as possible.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>Given that in the expansion of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1 + kx)^{10}\"></span> the coefficient <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3\"></span> is 3 times the coefficient of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>,</p><p>(b) find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
